    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1900970/extras/1b407f879ca18b815e33270dda63057c.avif?t=1696715799\" /></div><br><strong>The Red Hood</strong> is a horror game, based on &quot;Little Red riding hood&quot; folks.<br><br>The Red Hood is a first-person horror-memory game, where the main character is lost in the woods and you are not alone, there is a serial killer with a wolf mask and your main goal is to avoid him. <br>The gameplay is simple you should choose the right path to avoid a serial killer with a wolf mask if you die you will start the game from the beginning, remember the right paths, and good luck.<br><br>Features:<br>*Atmospheric visual<br>*Unique Mechanic<br>*Emotional gameplay<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1900970/extras/01987034ccabf542eddca2bfc68bf866.avif?t=1696715799\" /></div>",
